{\b Exchange RBAC Studio}\par
\par
This software administers Exchange Online RBAC for Applications in Microsoft 365 tenants. It changes tenant configuration only after an administrator reviews a validated plan and explicitly confirms execution.\par
\par
Use it only against tenants you are authorized to administer. Test changes in a non-production tenant first.\par
\par
Prerequisites (not installed by this package): PowerShell 7.4 or later, and the ExchangeOnlineManagement PowerShell module 3.7.0 or later.\par
